  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Harbor Chart",
    "overview": "Haven reads like a nautical chart of your own harbor: projects are harbors, environments are anchorages, services are marked buoys. The chart lends a palette, a legible type voice, density, and one signature move, the buoy strip.",
